{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear The Bell Toll is a roguelike city-building game focused on short satisfying runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Buy buildings from an Autochess style reroll-able shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/7c36a898c70545fe82bbf436c513ceb5.poster.avif?t=1759502537\" width=638 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/7c36a898c70545fe82bbf436c513ceb5.webm?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/7c36a898c70545fe82bbf436c513ceb5.mp4?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Place buildings on the grid strategically to maximize your profits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/ff7201a8cb15588aba3a1d35b4ad5245.poster.avif?t=1759502537\" width=732 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/ff7201a8cb15588aba3a1d35b4ad5245.webm?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/ff7201a8cb15588aba3a1d35b4ad5245.mp4?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Manage Class Synergies, Status effects like Crime and Sickness, and use game-changing Banners to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/06b365c41921df5a7d1f6a3b4b1e3727.poster.avif?t=1759502537\" width=1158 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/06b365c41921df5a7d1f6a3b4b1e3727.webm?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/06b365c41921df5a7d1f6a3b4b1e3727.mp4?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Collect Tribute in a multiplicative Population x Tax format to meet the requirements and proceed to the next year</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/e8ad27a1edabe5f93bc5b636be2a4d1b.poster.avif?t=1759502537\" width=526 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/e8ad27a1edabe5f93bc5b636be2a4d1b.webm?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903610/extras/e8ad27a1edabe5f93bc5b636be2a4d1b.mp4?t=1759502537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, as there are Calamities that occur every 3 years, and you must survive 25 years to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features in the full game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50+ buildings across 10 classes to build your city and get synergies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100+ unique game-changing modifiers in the form of Banners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many Status Effects (like Crime and Sickness) and Calamities to manage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Biomes and Ascension levels to challenge yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand drawn art-styl